    "method": "Seven counterbalanced before/after pairs for each CPU count. Two-thread busy target, parent controller, unrelated spinning peer. Each round freezes, observes completed freeze, verifies stable counters, thaws and waits for resumed progress. Identical pread observation and 50 us retry/resume sleep, because the baseline rejects cgroup epoll registration. Timed interval excludes initial setup and final cleanup.",
    "native_reference": "Existing ARM Linux Lima instance, six vCPUs, one/four CPU taskset affinity. Not bare-metal Darwin. The unchanged native fixture/reference samples are reused after the final Trames-only control transaction correction.",
