    "Controller deletion and replacement cannot redirect old control FDs; validation and mutation share one hierarchy transaction.",
    "A retained task handle cannot retire a replacement numeric PID; actual member retirement runs without an owner VFS projection.",
    "The original running execution lease survives non-leader exec rekey and clears the new member on completion.",
